      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Contemporary substantial 6 bed residence c. 3,500 sq ft with lofted garage c. 1,100 sq ft on c. 1 acre elevated plot. Featuring a bright, spacious, well maintained interior the property commans panoramic countryside views. Located c. 4.5 kn south of Inchigeelagh village and c. 40 minutes drive from Cork city.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, well water, private drainage, fibre broadband"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 7.5m x 2.5m \r\nTiled floor, bespoke wood and steel staircase, panoramic countryside views\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.8m x 4.4m \r\nOak floor, marble fireplace, oak tv stand and display unit\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 7.8m x 4.0m \r\nTiled floor, solid fuel stove, glass doors to patio, oak kitchen with breakfast bar, double oven, gas hob, fridge freezer, integrated dishwasher, double glass doors to sunroom\r\n\r\nSunroom - 4.4m x 4.2m \r\nWalnut floor, vaulted panel ceiling, french doors to rear patio\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 4.8m \r\nMarble fireplace, solid fuel stove\r\n\r\nRear Hall - 2.5m x 1.8m \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 4.0m x 2.5m \r\nTiled floor, fitted kitchen with sink unit, washing machine, dryer\r\n\r\nShower Room - 2.0m x 1.8m \r\nTiled, shower unit, vanity unit, w.c.\r\n\r\nLanding 1 - 6.2m x 2.5m \r\nBeech floor, hotpress\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.0m x 4.8m \r\nWalnut floor, panoramic countryside views, full ensuite\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 5.0m x 3.8m \r\nBeech floor, full ensuite\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.4m x 4.0m \r\nBeech floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.4m x 4.0m \r\nBeech floor\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.8m x 2.4m \r\nTiled, 3 corner bath, shower unit, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nLanding 2 - 2.8m x 2.4m \r\nBeech floor, storage\r\n\r\nBedroom 5/Study - 6.0m x 5.0m \r\nWooden floor, full ensuite\r\n\r\nBedroom 6/Playroom - 5.0m x 4.8m \r\nWooden floor, full ensuite\r\n\r\n"
      },
